  "solution": {
    "text": "At anode : <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇌</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />At cathode : <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⇌</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math><br />Net cell reaction : <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇌</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>E</mi> <mrow> <mi>c</mi><mi>